#!/bin/bash
# Experiment H (grid refinement, Theorem 5): the eight p = 10 cells with n in {600, 1000},
# tau0 in {0.2, 0.5} x 200 reps, fine grid 0:0.025:0.5, no bootstrap = 1600 tasks.
#   for o in 0 800; do OFFSET=$o bsub < lsf/expH.lsf; done
# Summarize with analysis/agg_expH.py results/expH.
#BSUB -J expH[1-800]
#BSUB -q medium
#BSUB -W 4:00
#BSUB -n 1
#BSUB -M 8GB
#BSUB -R "rusage[mem=8GB]"
#BSUB -o logs/expH.%J.%I.out
#BSUB -e logs/expH.%J.%I.err
module load matlab/R2025b
TASK=$((${LSB_JOBINDEX:-1} + ${OFFSET:-0}))
MARK=logs/expH.done.$TASK
rm -f $MARK
matlab -nodisplay -nosplash -singleCompThread -batch "addpath(genpath('matlab')); run_expF_fits($TASK, 'tag', 'expH', 'B', 0, 'tauGrid', 0:0.025:0.5, 'n', [600 1000]); fclose(fopen('$MARK','w'));" &
PID=$!
while kill -0 $PID 2>/dev/null; do
  if [ -f $MARK ]; then sleep 30; kill -9 $PID 2>/dev/null; break; fi
  sleep 20
done
echo "task $TASK finished"
